From ae05a87b195be191218afe9191c08f7396c6f126 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:42:49 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Search: online playlists open as playlist pages; clear search
 on leaving; queue prompt fix
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Online playlists in search results open on the normal Playlist page (tracks are
  fetched first, with a progress bar on the row) instead of the quick browse
  sheet; Play plays the whole playlist.
- Leaving Search for Home or Library saves the typed query as a recent search and
  empties the search bar. Opening a result doesn't count as leaving.
- The search bar no longer grabs focus or the keyboard when returning to the app:
  auto-focus happens once per visit and focus is dropped when the app is stopped.
- Queue options "Song or artist…" box: the queue layer was removed whenever the
  keyboard showed, which destroyed the box and closed the menu as soon as it was
  tapped. The layer now stays while the queue is open (also fixes the
  save-as-playlist search field).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EzyBeBJGG55RsMKWmRWTnP
